{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Backrooms: Exploration</strong> is a single-player horror game, which takes place in 2020. Two friends have lost their jobs due to COVID-19, but they still have to bring food to the table. After a failed heist, one of them ends up in the Backrooms. Now your only mission is to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3423660/extras/70cbf13fa0f369fec170590974591320.avif?t=1746976643\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3423660/extras_big/70cbf13fa0f369fec170590974591320.avif?t=1746976643 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Backrooms: Exploration</strong>, you have to find your way out of the Backrooms. Everything is viewed through a Bodycam which is mounted on your head.\u00a0<strong>Backrooms: Exploration</strong> is  an atmospherical experience, which entertains everyone who enjoys the Backrooms.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the many levels of Backrooms in the most realistic way.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience this unique story about the Backrooms.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not recommended for lower-end systems.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some parts of this game are heavily inspired by <strong>Kane Pixels</strong>' work.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Reader","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3423660/3e819f89f1647ac65bfd6bf4e194a667c861d636.jpg"},{"name":"Wonderer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3423660/17af9c1656c0df0b8e8e279551fec9146ff0d394.jpg"},{"name":"Investigator","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steam